# Portfolio core

- Static Astro only; no backend, CMS, or auth.
- Social/email URLs only in `src/config/site.ts`; components import config.
- Never invent employment, metrics, awards, or product features. Use `draft: true` or placeholders.
- Commercial MDX: high-level abstraction; optional quiet confidentiality note.
- Filtering projects: static routes (`/projects/commercial`, etc.), not client-side filter libraries.
- Islands only for theme toggle and mobile nav if needed.
